{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Habachi": 7,
    "Najat": 48,
    "Player": 16
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2304002",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Najat",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400201": {
            "id": "230400201",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Ugh, these Red Vultures! They just won't leave, will they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400202"
            ]
          },
          "230400202": {
            "id": "230400202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Excuse me, what happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400203"
            ]
          },
          "230400203": {
            "id": "230400203",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Are you... the Traveler? I've heard about you from Ebeid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400204"
            ]
          },
          "230400204": {
            "id": "230400204",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Hehe, we don't usually see many travelers around, so I wasn't expecting you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400205"
            ]
          },
          "230400205": {
            "id": "230400205",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Oh, have you met Habachi? The lad's always so strict — makes him seem unapproachable at times. Please don't feel offended though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400206"
            ]
          },
          "230400206": {
            "id": "230400206",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "You see, we've got all sorts of stuff stored here, not just food but also clothes, weapons, and even Mora and goods...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400207"
            ]
          },
          "230400207": {
            "id": "230400207",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "There aren't many young people in this place, and they need to manage all kinds of things, from protecting the village to the daily affairs of villagers. As a result, Habachi has been the only person on the warehouse-guarding duty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400208"
            ]
          },
          "230400208": {
            "id": "230400208",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "I can't help him much except for keeping accounts and tallying goods.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400209"
            ]
          },
          "230400209": {
            "id": "230400209",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's with the Red Vultures?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400210"
            ]
          },
          "230400210": {
            "id": "230400210",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "*sigh* Don't get me started. We just received a batch of jerky in the warehouse...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400211"
            ]
          },
          "230400211": {
            "id": "230400211",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "I guess it's the scent or something that has attracted these birds. Anyway, they started lurking on the hill near the warehouse from time to time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400212"
            ]
          },
          "230400212": {
            "id": "230400212",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "They can't have their way with the jerky locked in the warehouse, but whoever eats in front of them becomes an easy target instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400213"
            ]
          },
          "230400213": {
            "id": "230400213",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Our guards are too busy to come and get rid of them, nor is Habachi available...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400214"
            ]
          },
          "230400214": {
            "id": "230400214",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Traveler, if you have time, could you deal with them for us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400216",
              "230400218"
            ]
          },
          "230400216": {
            "id": "230400216",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Thank you so much. Those vultures are fierce. You might want to keep your distance. I'd suggest using a bow and arrow to get rid of them. It's safer."
          },
          "230400218": {
            "id": "230400218",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Yes, lots of things, actually — the goods we're transporting, the meat we're drying, and also Habachi's lunchboxes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400219"
            ]
          },
          "230400219": {
            "id": "230400219",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Every time Habachi's having lunch while on duty, the vultures always come snatch his meat away when he's not watching.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400220"
            ]
          },
          "230400220": {
            "id": "230400220",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "The poor lad can't leave his post to chase after them, so he has to make do with what's left...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400221"
            ]
          },
          "230400221": {
            "id": "230400221",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "So, please get rid of the vultures for us."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304003",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all Red Vultures",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400301": {
            "id": "230400301",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "So, please get rid of the vultures for us."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304004",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Najat",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400401": {
            "id": "230400401",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "How did it go? Did you take care of them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400404"
            ]
          },
          "230400404": {
            "id": "230400404",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Thank you so much! Habachi can finally have a peaceful lunch.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400405"
            ]
          },
          "230400405": {
            "id": "230400405",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Here, this is for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400406"
            ]
          },
          "230400406": {
            "id": "230400406",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Um... What else will arrive today?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304005",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Najat",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400501": {
            "id": "230400501",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "*sigh* Habachi should really allow himself some rest...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400502"
            ]
          },
          "230400502": {
            "id": "230400502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400503"
            ]
          },
          "230400503": {
            "id": "230400503",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Traveler, perfect timing! Could you help me with something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400504"
            ]
          },
          "230400504": {
            "id": "230400504",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "We just got some dried foods from outside the village. Habachi was about to deliver them here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400505"
            ]
          },
          "230400505": {
            "id": "230400505",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "But a group of Red Vultures was attracted by the smell and came whooshing down.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400506"
            ]
          },
          "230400506": {
            "id": "230400506",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Although the guards managed to drive them away quickly, they had scattered the food everywhere.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400507"
            ]
          },
          "230400507": {
            "id": "230400507",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Some people have left to warn other delivery teams, and Habachi's busy retrieving what is still edible. Traveler, could you help us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400509",
              "230400511"
            ]
          },
          "230400509": {
            "id": "230400509",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Thank you so much. My apologies, I've got another batch of goods coming in, so I can't go myself."
          },
          "230400511": {
            "id": "230400511",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "*sigh* I asked him to take a break, but he wouldn't listen. He said he'd go over the goods in the warehouse once he was done putting the scattered food back. He's overworking himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400512"
            ]
          },
          "230400512": {
            "id": "230400512",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "The goods should be near the White Lift. Please bring them to me, Traveler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304006",
      "subQuestName": "Retrieve the goods",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400601": {
            "id": "230400601",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "The goods should be near the White Lift. Please bring them to me, Traveler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304007",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Najat",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400701": {
            "id": "230400701",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Traveler, did you get the goods?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400702"
            ]
          },
          "230400702": {
            "id": "230400702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yes, got them right here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400703"
            ]
          },
          "230400703": {
            "id": "230400703",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Great! Please leave them there. Thank you so much.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400704"
            ]
          },
          "230400704": {
            "id": "230400704",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Habachi is tallying some other stuff in the warehouse. I'll take care of the food here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400705"
            ]
          },
          "230400705": {
            "id": "230400705",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "*sigh* Fingers crossed that we didn't lose too much food..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304008",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Najat",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400801": {
            "id": "230400801",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Ah, Traveler, thank goodness you've come! Please go help Habachi!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400804"
            ]
          },
          "230400804": {
            "id": "230400804",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "*sigh* A group of Treasure Hoarders suddenly showed up outside the village and stopped one of our delivery teams. We've summoned every guard available to help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400805"
            ]
          },
          "230400805": {
            "id": "230400805",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "But Habachi said that was not enough, so he also grabbed a weapon to join the guards.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400806"
            ]
          },
          "230400806": {
            "id": "230400806",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "I heard there are too many Treasure Hoarders this time. Habachi can't handle them on his own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230400807"
            ]
          },
          "230400807": {
            "id": "230400807",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Traveler, I've marked the location on the map. Please help him."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304009",
      "subQuestName": "Go and help Habachi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230400901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230400901": {
            "id": "230400901",
            "speakerId": 4421,
            "speakerName": "Najat",
            "text": "Traveler, please help Habachi. I... I'll see if I can get other people to help."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2304010",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Habachi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "230401002"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "230401002": {
            "id": "230401002",
            "speakerId": 4420,
            "speakerName": "Habachi",
            "text": "Huff... Thank you so much, Traveler. We wouldn't be able to keep the goods without you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230401004",
              "230401006"
            ]
          },
          "230401004": {
            "id": "230401004",
            "speakerId": 4420,
            "speakerName": "Habachi",
            "text": "Haha, I'm flattered. But I wouldn't be able to handle all of them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230401007"
            ]
          },
          "230401007": {
            "id": "230401007",
            "speakerId": 4420,
            "speakerName": "Habachi",
            "text": "*sigh* I wish I were stronger. If it were Candace, all of these Treasure Hoarders would be lying on the ground now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230401008"
            ]
          },
          "230401008": {
            "id": "230401008",
            "speakerId": 4420,
            "speakerName": "Habachi",
            "text": "My bad, there's no time for this. I've got to send the goods back to the village.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230401009"
            ]
          },
          "230401009": {
            "id": "230401009",
            "speakerId": 4420,
            "speakerName": "Habachi",
            "text": "Traveler, it's not safe around here. You should return as quickly as possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "230401010"
            ]
          },
          "230401010": {
            "id": "230401010",
            "speakerId": 4420,
            "speakerName": "Habachi",
            "text": "But when I think about it, the Treasure Hoarders sure keep their ears on the ground..."
          },
          "230401006": {
            "id": "230401006",
            "speakerId": 4420,
            "speakerName": "Habachi",
            "text": "There were other guards with me, but they went elsewhere to look for the goods."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}